"- Object 1 Capsule\n    - Attribute 1 Type - A two-part, elongated, oval-shaped capsule with a smooth, glossy surface, divided into two distinct halves.\n    - Attribute 2 Color - One half is solid black, and the other half is translucent orange.\n    - Attribute 3 Size - Approximately 2.5 to 3 centimeters in length, with a width of about 0.7 to 0.8 centimeters.\n    - Attribute 4 Material - Appears to be made of gelatin or a similar pharmaceutical-grade polymer, with a glossy finish.\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - Composed of two sealed halves, each with printed markings: the black half has the brand name \"actavis\" with a logo, and the orange half has the number \"500\".\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - One capsule.\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - Positioned horizontally, centered in the frame.\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - Lying flat with its long axis parallel to the bottom edge of the frame.\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - The two halves are fused together, forming a single, sealed unit with no visible seams or attachments.\n\n- Object 2 Printed Marking\n    - Attribute 1 Type - Two distinct printed markings on the capsule: one is a brand logo and text, and the other is a numerical value.\n    - Attribute 2 Color - The text and logo on the black half are grayish-white, and the number on the orange half is white.\n    - Attribute 3 Size - The text \"actavis\" is approximately 0.4 to 0.5 centimeters in height, and the number \"500\" is approximately 0.6 to 0.7 centimeters in height.\n    - Attribute 4 Material - Ink or laser-etched marking on the capsule surface.\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - Composed of printed characters: \"actavis\" with a stylized logo, and \"500\" in a bold, sans-serif font.\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - Two printed markings.\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - The \"actavis\" marking is on the black half, and the \"500\" marking is on the orange half, both aligned along the central axis of the capsule.\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - Both markings are oriented parallel to the capsule's long axis, with the text facing forward.\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - The markings are directly printed onto the capsule surface and are integral to its design, with no physical connection or attachment to other objects."